WEBVTT

00:50:27.788 --> 00:50:34.746
the complications of systemic
complexity where, you know,

00:50:34.788 --> 00:50:38.663
multiple choices by thousands
of people end up creating

00:50:39.038 --> 00:50:45.913
a reality that possibly have designed
for how how to cut through that.

00:50:45.996 --> 00:50:51.913
Like an AI has to make a decision based
on a moment, on a specific data set.

00:50:52.329 --> 00:50:54.371
As those decisions get more powerful,

00:50:54.704 --> 00:51:00.204
how can we be confident that they don't
lead to this sort of system crashing